WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.323
In your Vault, choose Add Item. Enter the item name and the details you know. You can upload a photo or add one later.

00:00:09.323 --> 00:00:19.791
Open Category. Choose a universe, then the matching category and subcategory. Use the other sections for any additional details.

00:00:19.791 --> 00:00:29.689
Choose Save to Vault. Return to your Vault and search for the item by name. Start with one favorite piece at V L T D dot app.
